%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, sorry. Even though you went out of your way to invite\nme, I'm afraid I can't stay out late today.\d%K%P
「不了，我今天得早点回去。\n这么难得的邀请本来应该去的，真是抱歉…」%K%P
Although I would've really appreciated a free dinner.%K%P
虽然能省出一顿饭钱的诱惑确实让我很心动…%K%P
And I was pretty sure Mitoko would have allowed it if I\ngave her a call.%K%P
虽然打个电话回去的话一定会得到原谅…%K%P
On the other hand, she would have also come up with a\ncomment or two to claw at my heart.%K%P
但是，不难想象我到时候恐怕会引发一两个\n令我肝肠寸断的不愉快。%K%P
