%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dUm... am I supposed to interpret this as...\d%K%P
「额，那也就是说…」%K%P
