...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Ah.\d%K%P
「…啊」%K%P
I spotted a small silhouette dallying in front of my\ndestination -- the Terrace House Hinosaka.%K%P
通向Terrace House阳之坂的道路直直地延伸过来。\n再一点点地往前走，我的目的地浮现出些许影子。%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
%XS10\d...Ah.\d %XE%K%P
「…啊」%K%P
The silhouette seemed to have noticed me as well, wavering\nslightly.%K%P
那影子好像也注意到了我，\n出现了些许的摇动。%K%P
This, in turn, made me quicken my previously sluggish\npace.%K%P
所以我悄悄地加快了脚步，\n想要早点到达。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm home.\d%K%P
「…我回来了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWelcome back. Congrats on surviving your first day.\d%K%P
「欢迎回来。\n头天上班辛苦了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat are you doing out here?\d%K%P
「为什么待在这个地方？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm... enjoying the cool evening breeze?\d%K%P
「嗯～，乘凉」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's still pretty cold, you know.\d%K%P
「现在还是有点冷啊」%K%P
It was still May, and already pretty late at night. Not\neven the days had become that hot yet.%K%P
现在是五月中旬，而且还是晚上。\n又不是黄昏十分。而且白天本来也不怎么热。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThe moon looks really...\d%K%P
「月亮非常地…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dRed.\d%K%P
「红呢」%K%P
The moon -- perched high in the night sky -- had taken on\na hue of putrid red through the exhaust fumes\ncontaminating our air.%K%P
姗姗来迟的满月\n挂在云雾弥漫的天空泛出淡红的颜色。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou sure like to complain about the tiniest of details.\nYou'll never find a wife if you keep acting like this, Mr.\nLaid-off.\d%K%P
「失业先生你真是太喜欢在意这些细节了。\n这样下去无论过多少年也不会有人愿意嫁给你的哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, speaking of which, I would like to bring to your\nattention that I'm no longer unemployed.\d%K%P
「是不是在意细节先不说，\n我已经不是失业者了吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's exactly what I was talking about. Stop complaining\nabout every single thing.\d%K%P
「这就是我说的，你太在意细节了。\n每件事都计较不停」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry.\d%K%P
「抱歉」%K%P
I decided not to mention that she far outclassed me when\nit came to sermons and complaints.%K%P
面对这凌驾于我之上，{夸我细心:净是责备我}的少女，\n这回我没有特意反驳。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd you should do something about apologizing all the\ntime, too.\d%K%P
「你还是先把一个劲道歉的毛病改过来吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'll try to be careful.\d%K%P
「…我会注意的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYep.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
It seemed like our mighty landlord's anger over this\nmorning's incident had mysteriously abated.%K%P
这一连串的对话让我知道\n房东大人今天早上的怒火已经平息下来了。%K%P
I guess I could count myself lucky.%K%P
这对我来说，\n真是应该对天地感恩戴德地顶礼膜拜啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, I suppose I was kinda out of line as well. I'm\nsorry. You're gonna find someone sooner or later. ...You\ndeserve passing grades in terms of looks, at the very\nleast.\d%K%P
「嘛，我说的也有点过分了。对不起。\n失业先生的话，不久一定会找到个合适伴侣的。\n…因为只从外表上看的话，你是个认真的人」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's fine. I'm no longer planning to marry, anyway.\d%K%P
「没什么的。\n我反正也已经不打算结婚了」%K%P
I would've loved to hear what she meant by that \dat the\nvery least\d, though.%K%P
虽然很想吐槽『只从外表上看』这种话语上的细节。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHey... You don't need to give up on your life just\nbecause my mother turned you down.\d%K%P
「怎么能这样想…\n你只不过是被我妈妈甩了而已，\n对人生失去信心未免太早了哦」%K%P
I had to resist protesting. I had to.%K%P
不要反驳、不要反驳…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I admit that's a part of it, but it's not the whole\nstory. I guess you could say it was more like a catalyst\nto having my eyes opened.\d%K%P
「不，嘛，虽然也有那个原因，但那也只是个契机而已。\n大概是通过这次的事，让我体会到了什么吧…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOpened to what?\d%K%P
「体会到了什么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat I can't even seem to tell what other people are\nfeeling. Whether they're happy or sad, depressed or\noverjoyed...\d%K%P
「不明白那个人在想些什么啊。我一定是不明白。\n是痛苦的事么，是悲伤的事么，还是说是开心的事、快乐的事呢…」%K%P
And that was why I led a more or less isolated existence.\nI would always apologize even if the person in question\nwasn't really angry -- I knew it was a sure-fire way to\nget myself off the hook.%K%P
正因为如此，\n我不想成为任何人的障碍而只能去刻意配合对方。\n就算对方不是真生气，我首先还是会选择道歉。%K%P
It wasn't like Mitoko was the first person to tell me\nthat. I simply couldn't help it anymore.%K%P
虽然这一点至今也曾被人指出过。\n但只是…一直没有改过来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDespite knowing that someone like me could never make\nanother person happy, I...\d%K%P
「我就是这个样子…\n我明白自己无法给人幸福，所以只能这样子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Mitoko silently listened to my slightly pathetic\nsoliloquy.%K%P
听到我这有些自作可怜的独身宣言，\n美都子沉默着无视了。%K%P
...Well, not like you could listen to it if you were\nloudly chattering anyway.%K%P
…不，说着话来无视是不可能的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt really is cold outside.\d%K%P
「外面果然很冷啊」%K%P
