%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOh, puh-lease. I bet even I could do that.\d%K%P
「什～么嘛。只是这样的话，感觉我也能行啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm pretty sure you could.\d%K%P
「大概可以吧，是你的话」%K%P
I tried not to mention all the unsettling things that\nhappened.%K%P
当然，为了让自己的心能一直像这星空般闪耀，\n不让乌云漂浮到这和平的风景里，\n我极力控制着话题的方向。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, I guess first days are more or less like that.\nYou're only gonna get busier and busier from now on,\nright?\d%K%P
