%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGood, good. Go knock 'em dead, Mr. Laid-off.\d%K%P
「嗯嗯，加油吧，失业先生」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'll do that.\d%K%P
「………我会加油的」%K%P
I really wish she'd stop calling me that already...%K%P
虽然又出现了我想要吐槽的地方…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo, how about your day? Anything good happen?\d%K%P
「那，你又是怎么了？\n有什么高兴的事么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...How could you tell? I thought you sucked at\nunderstanding how others felt.\d%K%P
「…为什么给你看出来了啊？\n你就没有点看不出别人内心的迟钝吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, we've known each other for over a month now. It\njust adds up, I guess.\d%K%P
「那是因为毕竟一起住了一个月了嘛。终究还是看得出来啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's like we're stuck with each other. Ahaha.\d%K%P
「只是生活了这么点时间就产生了孽缘呢，啊哈哈」%K%P
Of course I could tell.%K%P
这我知道。%K%P
Despite being furious in the morning, she was all chipper\nnow.%K%P
今天早上明明很是惹她生气了的，\n但她现在已经恢复了心情。%K%P
One month was enough for me to learn of her habits --\nshe'd give me the cold shoulder for three days even if she\nhad already forgiven me in her heart.%K%P
从这只有一个月的经验来说，\n暂不论真实想法，她那种嗔怒的态度最少也应该持续三天才对。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah, something good happened.\d%K%P
「嗯，确实有让我开心的事」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWould you mind telling me? I'd like to listen to\nsomething other than complai... Never mind.\d%K%P
「能告诉我吗？\n偶尔也说点责备之外的…啊，没什么」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUp until last year, a really good friend of mine lived\nnext door.\d%K%P
「一直到去年都住在隔壁的…\n我最喜欢的姐姐回来了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Next door?\d%K%P
「………邻居？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah, in that house. See? The lights are on right now.\d%K%P
「嗯，那边的房子。\n你看，今天晚上亮着灯吧？」%K%P
Mitoko's right hand pointed at the house to the left of\nthe Terrace House Hinosaka...%K%P
美都子右手指着的方向是\nTerrace House阳之坂的左邻…%K%P
A lavish house -- a mansion, even -- that loomed above our\nhumble abode like a mountain.%K%P
那边的建筑物远远凌驾在阳之坂之上，\n是栋说是大宅子也不为过的独门独户。%K%P
Although I'd never seen its lights go on before, I could\nnow sense the presence of inhabitants beyond its brightly-\nlit windows.%K%P
直到上周还一直黑乎乎的宅邸，\n现在被点亮之后确实能感觉到人的气息。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShe moved in about three years ago. And she was like this\nsuper rich lady, driving everywhere in a white limousine.\nWhat's more, she was attending Shuusen's prep school, of\nall places! You know about Shuusen, right?\d%K%P
「大概三年之前搬过来的。\n每天坐一辆白色高级轿车去学校，是个很不得了的大小姐。\n而且之前在秋泉大学附属中学读书！秋泉你知道么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yeah... It's pretty famous.\d%K%P
「知、知道…很有名的」%K%P
A white limousine...%K%P
白色高级轿车…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd while she was super rich, she'd never let it show in\nher attitude. She was always really kind to me and my\nmother.\d%K%P
「就是这么一个有钱的大小姐，\n却从来不炫耀自己的富贵。\n对我还有妈妈都非常温柔」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see...\d%K%P
「这样的啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI was really sad when, last year, she told me she'd be\ngoing to a university in the US. I kinda ended up crying a\nbit... a lot, actually, and caused her all sorts of\ntrouble.\d%K%P
「去年听说她要去美国留学的时候我很难过…\n稍微，啊不，狠狠地哭了一场，让她感到为难了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
The address of the mansion to the left of our boarding\nhouse was East Hagimori 3-23. The exact same address I had\nseen on the card earlier today.%K%P
这个公寓的左邻就是东荻守三丁目２３号。\n名片上写的内容，也恰好一致。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd she suddenly came back to Japan today! I mean,\nimagine my surprise...\d%K%P
「今天突然回国了，\n真是吃了一惊…」%K%P
But there was an odd discrepancy between the girl Mitoko\nwas talking about and the \dMilady\d I met today.%K%P
但是，美都子所说的『姐姐』\n和我遇到的『大小姐』是…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShe was already a looker when we were at school together,\nbut after she went through university, she's like a\ncomplete beauty now. Oh, right, I forgot to mention her\nname...\d%K%P
「高中的时候就已经很漂亮了，\n成为大学生之后，又变漂亮了好多。\n啊，对了，还没跟你说她的名字…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSawashima Himeo...\d%K%P
「泽嶋姬绪…小姐」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo you did meet her! She's super beautiful, but also\nreally open and kind with everyone! Like, I've never seen\na more perfect person in my life!\d%K%P
「见过了啊！\n是个又直爽又温柔的大美女，\n简直看不到缺点对吧～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHa, haha...\d%K%P
「哈、哈哈…」%K%P
